	Vendetta!\nCapped at 32 players\, so enter while supplies last! \n  \n🗓️ : 
	July 24\, 2026 \n📍: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nE
	vent Overview: \n\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss Rounds\nExp
	ected Number of Rounds: 3\nEntry: $25\nRegistration 👉 https://locator.rift
	bound.uvsgames.com/events/659498\n\n  \n📋 Registration Details: \n\nDoors 
	Open: 3:00 PM\nOn-Site Registration: 6:00 PM\nRound 1 Begins: 7:00 PM\n\nh
	ttps://ccs-houston.com/events/riftbound-vendetta-pre-rift-pre-release-even
	t/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
